test/amazon-meta-resume.test.js: on this tree neither board is requested by any entry point
(snapshot CLI, fetchLive, probe recon/full/raw), in the matrix, merged, built or listed; on a
copy of the tree with only the two paused fields deleted, the matrix, crawl (synthetic sites),
beta gate, merge + ledger, archive ingest (deep-equal reconstruct), beta build, company list and
market comps all pick both up.
test/amazon-meta-adapters.test.js: §7e/§7g formats: pay table orders, hourly, monthly, CAD,
JPY/INR/GBP, national sentence, row choice, cap and partition coverage, robots, 503 retry,
search errors; Meta annual/monthly/hourly pay, country pick, JSON-LD fallback, decoys, 403 wall.

